    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f18ad4fbc04eea1f074e8c0b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "叫我稻荷一就好，不用这么客套。\n今后还要一起踏上漫长～的旅程呢。对吧，大姐！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "01d49e68b72449f4f08fd902ae5ec69af2f1b32d1eb141b338452ad656680ef6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
