      "source_text": "（让新人赛马娘们来场模拟赛……虽然能够理解，\n但也太突然了吧？而且为什么当天才说？嗯……）",
      "source_fingerprint": "5efac04c3beb859473621e41b03fb18d154a6f933fc77422bfff366ba5d4b614",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
